{
    "title": "Boost Visual Voicemail",
    "description": "Boost Visual Voicemail (VVM) is an enhanced voicemail experience with messages delivered directly to your device. Boost Visual Voicemail allows you to listen to messages in any order, update your contacts, and easily manage/search your inbox without dialing or entering passwords.\r\n\r\nBoost Visual Voicemail Features:\r\n\r\nMANAGE YOUR INBOX: With Boost VVM you can save and manage voicemail messages in your inbox, just like your email.\r\n\r\nNEVER MISS A MESSAGE AGAIN: Whether you\u2019re in a meeting, running errands, or just too busy, the Boost VVM app will make sure all your messages are in one place for whenever you\u2019re ready to listen to them.\r\n\r\nPERSONALIZE GREETING: The Boost VVM app allows you to create your own customized greeting.\r\n\r\nTAKE CONTROL: Boost VVM keeps your voicemails on your device \u2013 without worrying about them being deleted or lost when you upgrade to a new phone.\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: \r\n\u2022 A core feature of backing up, restoring voicemail messages, and device-to-device transfer of voicemail messages requires \u201cAll file access\u201d\r\n\u2022 Standard messaging and data rates may apply\r\n\u2022 Boost VVM App is free\r\n\u2022 Carriers supported: DISH, Boost Mobile\r\n\u2022 Requires Android 8.0 OS or higher",
    "descriptionHTML": "Boost Visual Voicemail (VVM) is an enhanced voicemail experience with messages delivered directly to your device. Boost Visual Voicemail allows you to listen to messages in any order, update your contacts, and easily manage/search your inbox without dialing or entering passwords.<br><br>Boost Visual Voicemail Features:<br><br>MANAGE YOUR INBOX: With Boost VVM you can save and manage voicemail messages in your inbox, just like your email.<br><br>NEVER MISS A MESSAGE AGAIN: Whether you\u2019re in a meeting, running errands, or just too busy, the Boost VVM app will make sure all your messages are in one place for whenever you\u2019re ready to listen to them.<br><br>PERSONALIZE GREETING: The Boost VVM app allows you to create your own customized greeting.<br><br>TAKE CONTROL: Boost VVM keeps your voicemails on your device \u2013 without worrying about them being deleted or lost when you upgrade to a new phone.<br><br>PLEASE NOTE: <br>\u2022 A core feature of backing up, restoring voicemail messages, and device-to-device transfer of voicemail messages requires \u201cAll file access\u201d<br>\u2022 Standard messaging and data rates may apply<br>\u2022 Boost VVM App is free<br>\u2022 Carriers supported: DISH, Boost Mobile<br>\u2022 Requires Android 8.0 OS or higher",
